  "units": [
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d6d9fd000000001d026e12:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u1",
      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "一面凉～～\n🌍背景：\n几个月前找实习的时候投了字节电商，上周才被HR打电话说要约面试。估计是人不够了才开始海底捞了。因为准备仓促，我是抱着赴死的心态去面的。\n📔面试前准备：\n没大量刷题，就面试前几个小时慢悠悠地做了一道leetcode中等题练手。\n💻面试过程：\n先向面试官简单介绍了一下自己和简历上没写上的两端实习经历。这一招之前对上次Deeplang的面试官凑效，但是这回面试官不吃这套，只拷问我第一段初创的实习经历。这段经历里面各种架构都比较简陋，再加上时间长了有点忘了，很不占巧\n针对简历问的问题：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "9520c86dd0b23c64e9d2328e9fe4734971d6c4267db8bfe114ff72c0cf54bd74",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b585210bd6b64112e5b87aa128ee2c88fc4f13ffca2cd2f499e171d7c0072e0b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d6d9fd000000001d026e12:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "1. 用户退出完了怎么返回数据给用户（存到数据库上，每次用户进去从数据库里拉）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "9520c86dd0b23c64e9d2328e9fe4734971d6c4267db8bfe114ff72c0cf54bd74",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b585210bd6b64112e5b87aa128ee2c88fc4f13ffca2cd2f499e171d7c0072e0b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d6d9fd000000001d026e12:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2. 问SaaS是什么，消息队列用的是Kafka、RocketMQ还是RabbitMQ，写的消息队列是怎么实现的（他没理解云函数和我们模型推理使用的服务器是分开的，我跟他掰扯了好久；他想象的消息队列应该是自己写个kafka那种的，而我写的是一个有队列（数据结构）功能的服务。当时做这功能的时候我们调研了，kafka太贵了所以没用，所以自己搞了一个这个简单的。然后这又掰扯了好久。），把消息入队的并发处理又是怎么搞的。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "9520c86dd0b23c64e9d2328e9fe4734971d6c4267db8bfe114ff72c0cf54bd74",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b585210bd6b64112e5b87aa128ee2c88fc4f13ffca2cd2f499e171d7c0072e0b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67d6d9fd000000001d026e12:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "他：你把这消息存云函数内存上，服务器崩了不就没办法了？\n我：那确实。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67d6d9fd000000001d026e12.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "9520c86dd0b23c64e9d2328e9fe4734971d6c4267db8bfe114ff72c0cf54bd74",
